## 1. CMIS

**Config class:** `CmisConfig.java` in `connectors/cmis/connector/src/main/java/.../cmis/`

| Constant Name | Param String | Description | Default | Required |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| `USERNAME_PARAM` | `username` | CMIS username | `dummyuser` | Yes |
| `PASSWORD_PARAM` | `password` | CMIS password | `dummysecrect` | Yes |
| `PROTOCOL_PARAM` | `protocol` | Connection protocol (http/https) | `http` | Yes |
| `SERVER_PARAM` | `server` | CMIS server hostname | `localhost` | Yes |
| `PORT_PARAM` | `port` | Server port | `9090` | Yes |
| `PATH_PARAM` | `path` | AtomPub API context path | `/chemistry-opencmis-server-inmemory/atom` | Yes |
| `REPOSITORY_ID_PARAM` | `repositoryId` | CMIS Repository ID | `""` (empty) | Optional |
| `BINDING_PARAM` | `binding` | Protocol binding: `atom`, `ws`, `browser` | `atom` | Yes |
| `CMIS_QUERY_PARAM` | `cmisQuery` | CMIS query (job specification) | — | Optional |
| `VENDOR_PARAM` | `cmisVendor` | CMIS vendor selection (alfresco, other, etc.) | `other` | Optional |
| `GROUP_API_URL_PARAM` | `groupApiUrl` | Group List API URL path (deprecated) | `""` | Optional |
| `GROUP_MEMBERS_API_URL_PARAM` | `groupMembersApiUrl` | Group Members API URL template (deprecated) | `""` | Optional |
| `GROUP_API_TEST_RESULT_PARAM` | `groupApiTestResult` | Transient test result (not persisted) | — | Optional |
| `SKIP_ACL_WAIT_PARAM` | `skipAclWait` | Skip ACL wait before indexing | `false` | Optional |
| `MAX_FILE_SIZE_PARAM` | `maxFileSize` | Max file size in bytes (0 = no limit) | `0` | Optional |

