| `NODE_MAXFETCHESPERMINUTE` | `maxfetchesperminute` | `value` | Max fetch rate per bin |
| `NODE_ACCESSCREDENTIAL` | `accesscredential` | `urlregexp`, `type` (basic/ntlm/session), `domain`, `username`, `password` | Authentication credentials |
| `NODE_AUTHPAGE` | `authpage` | `urlregexp`, `type` (form/link/redirection/content), `match`, `overridetargeturl` | Session auth page definitions |
| `NODE_AUTHPARAMETER` | `authparameter` | `name`, `value` | Auth form parameters |
| `NODE_TRUST` | `trust` | `urlregexp`, `truststore`, `trusteverything` | SSL trust configuration |

