| Node Constant | Node Name | Description |
|---|---|---|
| `NODE_SEEDS` | `seeds` | Seed URLs (text block) |
| `NODE_INCLUDES` | `includes` | Include URL regexps for crawling |
| `NODE_EXCLUDES` | `excludes` | Exclude URL regexps from crawling |
| `NODE_INCLUDESINDEX` | `includesindex` | Include URL regexps for indexing |
| `NODE_EXCLUDESINDEX` | `excludesindex` | Exclude URL regexps from indexing |
| `NODE_EXCLUDESCONTENTINDEX` | `excludescontentindex` | Exclude pages by body content regex |
| `NODE_LIMITTOSEEDS` | `limittoseeds` | Limit crawling to seed domains only |
| `NODE_FORCEINCLUSION` | `forceinclusionofredirects` | Force include redirected URLs |
| `NODE_URLSPEC` | `urlspec` | URL canonicalization rules |
| `NODE_ACCESS` | `access` | Forced ACL access tokens |
| `NODE_EXCLUDEHEADER` | `excludeheader` | Exclude specific HTTP headers from metadata |
| `NODE_MAP` | `map` | URL-to-URI mapping rules |

