## 12. File System

**Connector class:** `FileConnector.java` in `connectors/filesystem/connector/src/main/java/.../filesystem/`

The File System **repository** connector has **NO connection-level configuration parameters**. It accesses the local filesystem directly.

### Job specification parameters (variableContext):

| Parameter | Description |
|---|---|
| `specpath` | Root path to crawl |
| `converttouri` | Convert file paths to URIs |
| `specflavor` | Include/exclude |
| `spectype` | File or directory |
| `specmatch` | Filename match pattern |

**Note:** The **File System Output** connector (`FileOutputConnector`) has one config parameter:

| Enum Name | Param String | Description | Default |
|---|---|---|---|
| `ROOTPATH` | `ROOTPATH` | Root directory for output files | `""` |

