## Quick Reference: API Parameter Names for Programmatic Connection Creation

When creating connections via the ManifoldCF REST API (`/mcf-api-service/json/repositoryconnections/`), parameter names must match the **Param String** column exactly (case-sensitive). Example JSON for CMIS:

```json
{
  "repositoryconnection": {
    "name": "My CMIS Connection",
    "class_name": "org.apache.manifoldcf.crawler.connectors.cmis.CmisRepositoryConnector",
    "configuration": {
      "parameter": [
        { "_attribute_name": "username", "__value__": "admin" },
        { "_attribute_name": "password", "__value__": "admin" },
        { "_attribute_name": "protocol", "__value__": "https" },
        { "_attribute_name": "server", "__value__": "alfresco.example.com" },
        { "_attribute_name": "port", "__value__": "443" },
        { "_attribute_name": "path", "__value__": "/alfresco/api/-default-/cmis/versions/1.1/atom" },
        { "_attribute_name": "binding", "__value__": "atom" },
        { "_attribute_name": "repositoryId", "__value__": "-default-" }
      ]
    }
  }
}
```
